{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover over 100+ beautifully hand-drawn elements as you help your World evolve infinitely through time! And finally, maybe, you will know what came first - the chicken, or the egg?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begin your adventure with a burst of resources! Uncover treasure chests brimming with essential elements to kickstart your evolutionary journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/abd07aec21e4c123f08a8706c0aa5181.poster.avif?t=1745422418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/abd07aec21e4c123f08a8706c0aa5181.webm?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/abd07aec21e4c123f08a8706c0aa5181.mp4?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Core of Creation: Combine simple elements to unlock surprising and satisfying new discoveries. Experiment, innovate, and watch your World transform!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/c9495fd3378cec0b5959cfe22378d0af.poster.avif?t=1745422418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/c9495fd3378cec0b5959cfe22378d0af.webm?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/c9495fd3378cec0b5959cfe22378d0af.mp4?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li